          "ascii": "    [Host A]       [Host B]\n        \\             /\n         \\           /\n      +-----------------+\n      | CENTRAL SWITCH  |  <--- Single Point of Failure\n      |   / HUB (L2)    |\n      +-----------------+\n         /           \\\n        /             \\\n    [Host C]       [Host D]\n(Every transmission passes through the central switch)"
